    "voices_note": "config.json voices, in model order; both checkpoints carry the same list under 'voices'. The style tables have one row per voice. bf_isabella and bm_fable were trained on British misaki phonemes (en.G2P(british=True)); tools/misaki-g2p ships only the American lexicon, so only af_heart and am_puck have a matching native G2P.",
    "layout_note": "Every tensor has v1.1's name and shape except style: text_side.pt style (1, 32) -> (4, 32), decoder.pt style (1, 16) -> (4, 16). The weights are retrained, so af_heart audio differs from v1.1. tokenizer.json is byte-identical to v1.1's.",
